{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499464",
      "title": "Enabled & Disabled Queries",
      "sourceHash": "2eee9d64667671b65a2f9bbf1c2f03d281d8f110dbe28cd8a68d67a869ce41bb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "So now that we explored the behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 6.96,
          "en": "of React Query in depth, let's come back to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 9.09,
          "en": "Find your Next Event feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.09,
          "end": 11.73,
          "en": "and let's see if it actually works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 13.47,
          "en": "If I enter a search term here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "and I click search, that looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "If I change this and I click search,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "this also looks pretty good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "It seems to find results that make sense here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "for this search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 28.283,
          "en": "By the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.156,
          "end": 31.08,
          "en": "it searches the title, location and description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 32.63,
          "en": "And for example, for this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.669,
          "end": 36.69,
          "en": "where web dev does not occur in the title or the location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "it does occur in the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 40.99,
          "en": "So all these results are valid here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 45.57,
          "en": "and we get this valid and expected behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.57,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "because we're managing the search term as state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.5,
          "en": "So therefore this find event section component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.5,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "does re-execute whenever the state is changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "And since we're then using this state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 62.58,
          "en": "in the Use Query configuration, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.58,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "in the Query key and also here of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "as an input for this fetching function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 73.1,
          "en": "React Query goes ahead and sends different HTDP requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.17,
          "end": 76.23,
          "en": "for those difference search terms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.23,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "But now one thing where this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 81.72,
          "en": "maybe does not behave exactly as expected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.72,
          "end": 83.55,
          "en": "is when I reload this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.55,
          "end": 86.19,
          "en": "or when I visit it for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.19,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "Because in that case I see all those events down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "which kind of makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "because no search term was entered and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 98.58,
          "en": "of course we have no criteria to narrow those events down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.58,
          "end": 99.78,
          "en": "But of course, as a result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "I'm seeing the same events down here as I do up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "And of course, as a result, if we take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 108.36,
          "en": "at the network tab, we're sending two requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 111.12299999999999,
          "en": "to events, one from every section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "And we also can't change this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "with stale time or garbage collection time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.47,
          "en": "because we're using different Query keys here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.47,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "So the data from the Query in the first component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 126.39,
          "en": "the new events section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.39,
          "end": 130.413,
          "en": "wouldn't be reused here anyways, as I also explained before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "But nonetheless, we might wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "that we don't send this Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 138.48,
          "en": "in the find event section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 142.23,
          "en": "if we did not enter any search term at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.23,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "So we might want to disable this Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 148.59,
          "en": "until a search term has been entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.59,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "And that's of course also a pretty common requirement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "that some requests should not be sent instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 158.34,
          "en": "And it's a feature that's pretty easy to implement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.34,
          "end": 160.71,
          "en": "when using React Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.71,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "because this use Query configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "takes an enabled property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "and if you set this two false, the Query is disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 173.85,
          "en": "and will not be sent, so the request will not be sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.85,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "If you send it to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 177.963,
          "en": "it will be sent and that's the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 180.81,
          "en": "But now I wanna set it to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.81,
          "end": 183.81,
          "en": "if we did not enter a search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.81,
          "end": 185.22,
          "en": "Now to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.22,
          "end": 190.22,
          "en": "we could set enabled to search term unequal empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 195.12,
          "en": "which means it's true if the user did enter anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.12,
          "end": 198.93,
          "en": "and false otherwise, but this would actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.93,
          "end": 202.07999999999998,
          "en": "not achieve what I wanna achieve here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.07999999999998,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "because if I'm doing that and I reload, as a result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 209.25,
          "en": "I would not be seeing any results here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 211.38,
          "en": "I would see the loading indicator instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.38,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "but we'll fix this soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 216.231,
          "en": "But if I now enter, I would see results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.231,
          "end": 220.47,
          "en": "But if I go back to no search term,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.47,
          "end": 223.05,
          "en": "I would see that loading indicator again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.05,
          "end": 227.61,
          "en": "But maybe if I did enter something and I then go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.61,
          "end": 232.61,
          "en": "to no search term, I wanna see all events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.77,
          "end": 236.13,
          "en": "I just don't wanna see all those events initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.13,
          "end": 237.99,
          "en": "So there should be a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.99,
          "end": 241.98,
          "en": "between this input being empty initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 245.1,
          "en": "or being empty because the user cleared it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.1,
          "end": 249.15,
          "en": "At least that's the behavior I'd like to have in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.15,
          "end": 251.22,
          "en": "If the user did enter something else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.22,
          "end": 255.3,
          "en": "and then clears this input, I wanna show all events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.3,
          "end": 259.86,
          "en": "because the user probably looked for all events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.86,
          "end": 262.563,
          "en": "but initially I wanna show no event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.741,
          "end": 266.46,
          "en": "And to achieve this, I'll simply make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.46,
          "end": 270.57,
          "en": "that my search term state initially is undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.57,
          "end": 274.383,
          "en": "by not passing any value at all to use state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.55,
          "end": 277.35,
          "en": "And therefore then here I can check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 279.18,
          "en": "that this should only be enabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279.18,
          "end": 282.93,
          "en": "if search term is not equal to undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 282.93,
          "end": 284.73,
          "en": "So if it is undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.73,
          "end": 288.483,
          "en": "which is the initial value, this Query will be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "But if search term is anything else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "including an empty string, which would be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.2,
          "end": 298.38,
          "en": "if the user did clear the input field manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.38,
          "end": 301.683,
          "en": "it will be enabled and the request will be sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 304.71,
          "en": "And with that, I can now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.71,
          "end": 307.182,
          "en": "that initially I don't have any results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 307.182,
          "end": 310.86,
          "en": "but if I search something, I get that result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.86,
          "end": 314.38,
          "en": "And if I then clear that and search, I get all events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.27,
          "end": 318.39,
          "en": "which is exactly the behavior I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.39,
          "end": 321.06,
          "en": "Now I just also want to get rid of that loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 321.06,
          "end": 325.14,
          "en": "which we see initially and we're seeing that loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 325.14,
          "end": 329.52,
          "en": "because when a Query is disabled, which initially here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 329.52,
          "end": 333.51,
          "en": "in this component will be the case, React Query treats it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 333.51,
          "end": 336.9,
          "en": "as pending because we don't have any data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 336.9,
          "end": 339.72,
          "en": "And instead we're waiting for data to arrive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 339.72,
          "end": 342.75,
          "en": "which can only happen once the Query is enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 342.75,
          "end": 346.02,
          "en": "But that's why initially it treats it as is pending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 346.02,
          "end": 349.683,
          "en": "because it kind of waits for this Query to be enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.7,
          "end": 353.58,
          "en": "Now of course here, that's not really the behavior I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 353.58,
          "end": 356.55,
          "en": "I don't want a loading spinner if we're waiting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.55,
          "end": 359.13,
          "en": "for the user to enter something here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 359.13,
          "end": 361.11,
          "en": "And that's why React Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 361.11,
          "end": 363.843,
          "en": "gives us an alternative to is pending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.68,
          "end": 367.863,
          "en": "You can also use is loading Boolean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 369.09,
          "end": 371.13,
          "en": "The difference between is loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.13,
          "end": 376.13,
          "en": "and is pending is that is loading will not be true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 376.47,
          "end": 379.383,
          "en": "if this Query is just disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 380.97,
          "end": 384.54,
          "en": "So therefore, if I switch from is pending to is loading here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 384.54,
          "end": 388.44,
          "en": "in this if check and I save this now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 388.44,
          "end": 392.14,
          "en": "we start with this info text for the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 393.12,
          "end": 395.43,
          "en": "and I can then enter City",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 395.43,
          "end": 398.87,
          "en": "to briefly get that loading spinner and then my result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 398.87,
          "end": 403.02,
          "en": "and I can clear that to go back to all the search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 403.02,
          "end": 406.8,
          "en": "And I therefore now got exactly the behavior I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 406.8,
          "end": 411.78,
          "en": "with help of this Query enabling and disabling feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 411.78,
          "end": 413.913,
          "en": "And this is loading property.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}